<pvxbig>Assassin build which uses critical strikes and [[Shadow Theft@20]'s attribute bonuses to deal area damage with a scythe.</pvxbig>
== Skills and Attributes ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=A/D CriticalStrikes=12+1+3 ScytheMastery=12 EarthPrayers=3][Shadow Theft@20][Critical Eye@20][Pious Assault@17][Reap Impurities@17][Staggering Force@8][Aura of Thorns@8][Way of the Master@20][Critical Agility][/build]
;Variants
*{{skill pvxicon|Drunken Master}} – use with [[gww:alcohol|alcohol]]. Replace [[Critical Agility].
*{{skill pvxicon|Asuran Scan}} – bypass blocking and effects that cause your attacks to miss. Replace [[Critical Eye@20].
*{{skill pvxicon|"I Am Unstoppable!"}} – improved survivability and knock down/cripple immunity. Replace [[Critical Eye@20].
</pvxbig>

== Equipment ==
* [[gww:Vampiric|Vampiric]] scythe of [[gww:Of Fortitude|fortitude]] with "Strength and Honor!".
* Vampiric [[gww:Anniversary Shortbow "Whispers"|Anniversary Shortbow "Whispers"]] of fortitude with "Strength and Honor!". Use when you're unable to reach your target due to snares or terrain.
* Shield set for self-defense.

== Usage ==
<pvxbig>
*Maintain [[Critical Agility].
**When it self-renews it's placed on top of your enchantment stack, preventing effective covering.
*Prepare your flash enchantments [[Staggering Force] and [[Aura of Thorns] before and renew them during combat.
*Shadow step to a foe with [[Shadow Theft@16].
**Use the improved [[Critical Eye@20] and [[Way of the Master@20] afterwards.
**Keep using shadow theft on recharge so it self-buffes and improves your attributes by 6 instead of 5.
*Tear down your flash enchantments with [[Pious Assault@17] for additional damage.
*Against balling foes, use [[Reap Impurities@17] to translate the inflicted conditions into armour ignoring area damage.
</pvxbig>
== Counters ==
*Standard anti-physical.
*Standard anti-melee.
*Frequent/deep enchantment removal.
== Notes ==
<pvxbig>
*Under the effect of [[Shadow Theft@20] you'll gain 4 instead of 3 energy per critical hit. The break point for the additional energy gain is at 18 critical strikes.
</pvxbig>
